  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.4.0 of Zipwire.ProofPack.\n      - Add \"issued to\" functionality for proof certificate recipients\n      - New WithIssuedTo fluent API methods (WithIssuedToEmail, WithIssuedToPhone, WithIssuedToEthereum)\n      - Support for flexible key-value identifier system in proofs\n      - Comprehensive JSON structure validation and cross-platform compatibility\n      - Enhanced TimestampedMerkleExchangeBuilder and AttestedMerkleExchangeBuilder\n      - 35+ new unit and integration tests covering IssuedTo functionality",
